{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ukko & Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound",
    "steam_appid": 1961490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/UG_steam_page_header_616px.png?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br><strong>Ukko &amp; Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound</strong> is a charming puzzle game for all ages, transporting you into a magical connection between a reindeer and a maned wolf. By controlling one character at a time, you alternate between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 through a mystical link with a falling star to solve various challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br>\u2022\t<strong>Stunning Environments:</strong> Explore the lush subtropical climate of Guar\u00e1 and the icy Nordic environment of Ukko. Switch between these unique worlds to uncover mysteries and overcome challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/UG_environments_comparisson_616px.png?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Cooperative and Non-Violent Gameplay:</strong> There are no enemies to fight. The focus is on the magical cooperation and friendship between the protagonists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/216b8420228bc335e59bd8b25f90af77.avif?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Magical Interaction:</strong> Discover how to use different interactive objects and utilize weather changes to complete puzzles. Cast the star between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 to solve enigmas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.poster.avif?t=1725546623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.webm?t=1725546623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.mp4?t=1725546623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Spirit of Friendship and Innocence:</strong> With a non-violent approach, the game celebrates the innocence and purity of true friendship.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/454018e32daf64c472b56c4d7fee1f68.avif?t=1725546623\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why Play Ukko &amp; Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound?</h2><br>\u2022\t<strong>Engaging Challenges:</strong> With dozens of levels and unique puzzles, each challenge tests your creativity and problem-solving skills.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/e965e65e81282847cfce2e2c8ef31e52.avif?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>An Unforgettable Journey:</strong> Guide Ukko and Guar\u00e1 on this incredible journey through magical and atmospheric landscapes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/f78912b42eb1580e5270b8eba9e04d11.avif?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Family-Friendly Experience:</strong> A perfect game for the whole family, providing moments of fun and cooperation.<br><br>Discover the deep connection between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 while enjoying a unique and captivating gaming experience. Join this magical adventure and be enchanted by the beauty of <strong>Ukko &amp; Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound</strong>!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/UG_steam_page_header_616px.png?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br><strong>Ukko &amp; Guar\u00e1: Stellarbound</strong> is a charming puzzle game for all ages, transporting you into a magical connection between a reindeer and a maned wolf. By controlling one character at a time, you alternate between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 through a mystical link with a falling star to solve various challenges.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br>\u2022\t<strong>Stunning Environments:</strong> Explore the lush subtropical climate of Guar\u00e1 and the icy Nordic environment of Ukko. Switch between these unique worlds to uncover mysteries and overcome challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/UG_environments_comparisson_616px.png?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Cooperative and Non-Violent Gameplay:</strong> There are no enemies to fight. The focus is on the magical cooperation and friendship between the protagonists.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/216b8420228bc335e59bd8b25f90af77.avif?t=1725546623\" /></div><br><br>\u2022\t<strong>Magical Interaction:</strong> Discover how to use different interactive objects and utilize weather changes to complete puzzles. Cast the star between Ukko and Guar\u00e1 to solve enigmas.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.poster.avif?t=1725546623\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961490/extras/30da039fbcdc6837fb357381abfad71d.webm?t=17255466